==Battleground==
*5 [[Snache]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Zoge]] spawns as the boss after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*5 [[Snache]]s spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[Zoge]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

